WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.290
Tomorrow is the long-awaited Divine Idol Grand Prix Final Tournament-pri.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:10.580
We've gotta shatter the Diamond Statue to save Jewlie!

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.680
And to do that...

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:15.070
all of us need to give our all-pri!

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:16.960
I'll help too!

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.560
The first round is Dressing Pafe vs Garumageddon-kuma!

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.940
Dressing Pafe will be hard to defeat-nano!

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:25.710
Garu!

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.960
Demon Demon DeruDerubi~

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.040
It says "you will crucify your enemies".

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.050
What's up with this!?

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.050
Dorothy, stop fidgeting!

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.320
Stay calm and cool!

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.270
Who did this-usa?

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.320
We've come to give our support!

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:44.700
What's going on?

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.640
Get me down!

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.400
Now you know the true power of a demon!

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.600
There's an angel here too!

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.350
Garu!

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:56.060
Leona's more of an angel than you!

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:57.440
That's not true...

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.590
Farewell-devi!

00:00:58.590 --> 00:00:59.340
Garu!
Geru!

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:00.500
Get back here!

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.540
Wait!

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.930
Going up against children sure is tough-usa...

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:08.590
You'd be a fool to underestimate those children-nekon...

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:12.530
I'll debone you good and proper-nekon...

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:49.100
The Rockin'・Gajira Great Battle

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.110
Stupid kids and their pranks.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:54.710
Next time I see them, I'll give them a good spanking!

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:56.840
Dorothy, relax more.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:01.280
We must win, and then face off against Solami Smile.

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:06.160
Even though it's like a lion chasing a rabbit, we must fight Garumageddon with all we have.

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:07.620
What does that mean?

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:12.670
She means that even a lion tries it's hardest to catch something as small as a rabbit-usa.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:16.400
So we've gotta make our Making Drama better then, right?

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:17.780
Exactly.

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:23.840
So they're looking down on us, comparing us to rabbits?

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:26.590
Underestimate a demon, and you'll get burned!

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:27.310
Garu!

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:30.710
Demon Demon DeruDerubi~

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:35.220
"Bestow upon your enemies with a devil's lullaby"

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:39.920
A stronger Making Drama...

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.800
I got it! Shiopoy...

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.040
Immediate rejection!

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:50.330
You fools, listen to my devil lullaby-dearu!

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.690
Go play somewhere else!

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.780
Hell has up to a hundred lullabies-dearu!

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.220
There's so many-nano!

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:08.020
Be good now children and leave us be-usa.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:10.550
That's...

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:15.610
My rabbit instincts are making me-usa...

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.460
Ah-usa...

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:21.320
Nuisances will face Forced Expulsion! No Questions!

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.980
Demon Demon DeruDerubi~

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:29.450
"Use the Devil's Incarnations in the meantime"

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:31.500
The Angel will give you some as presents!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.620
And Garuru too-garu!

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.670
They're real!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.820
Dorothy, relax!

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:44.800
Presence of Mind! Stay calm.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.580
Devi Devi Devi Devi!
Geru Geru Geru Geru!

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:49.430
You must enjoy our banquet!

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:51.130
Everyone be friends!

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:53.120
Devi Geru Garu!

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:54.000
Ah!

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:54.240
Devi Geru Garu!

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.460
Garumageddon were here!

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:57.480
They're fast at running away-pri!

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:58.650
Wait!

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.410
Pshuu...

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.920
Tomorrow is the Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:07.030
Why are you pulling pranks?

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:08.570
They're not "pranks".

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:11.280
They're devilish tactics-dearu.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:14.350
Relaxing-usa...

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:21.210
It's been so long since I've felt this, I'm so happy-usa...

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:25.030
I'm also happy, it's been a while since

00:05:25.030 --> 00:05:28.560
I've deboned and turned a rabbit in to mush, making them miss the Gran Prix like this-nekon.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:37.420
Even if you say they're "devilish tactics".

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.730
It's not right-pri.

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:44.910
I want to save Jewlie, so I want us all to aim for Divine Idol!

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.680
Naturally, I'm supporting you guys too.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:50.030
This is how we compete-dearu!

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.790
Well you're wrong-pri!

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:55.670
Bad!

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:03.200
Garuru! I've come to support you all for tomorrow-dechu!

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.700
We're here!

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:08.480
Unicorn and the gang!
Garuru is so happy!

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:10.260
Garumaggedon are gonna win aren't they?

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.740
Right?
Right!

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:13.110
Sorry to interrupt!

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:16.390
Telegram for Aroma-san and Mikan-san!

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:17.810
Telegram?

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.170
Geru?

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:20.640
USB?

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:29.350
Hey Onee-chan! Congratulations on being in the

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:31.240
Divine Idol Gran Prix final!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.110
Ah, it's Anko!

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:35.450
Miruku-chan and Kero-chan are there too!

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:41.150
We'll support Garumageddon with all we've got tommorow, so

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:45.520
Well said, my demonlets.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.350
Thank so much-nano!

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.510
What a wonderful message!

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:50.500
Garu!

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:56.020
Despite being cheered on so much, all you do is pull pranks-pri?

00:06:57.940 --> 00:07:00.480
Devils only get serious from the afternoon onwards.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:04.450
We're just about to make a better making drama.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:08.040
Demon Demon DeruDerubi~

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:13.660
In order to win, we have to create the best Making Drama!

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.320
Got it-nano!

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:17.060
Garuru will think of ideas-garu!

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:19.400
Sounds fun, Capisce!

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:36.670
Usa!? Ah this is no good-usa...

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:40.100
Tomorrow is the final, I've gotta get my act together-usa!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:45.150
I'm starving, let's go home!

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:48.360
But our making drama isn't done yet...

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:53.270
Usagi never came back either, he's probably slacking off...

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:56.400
Now that you mention it he did never come back...

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:59.460
Okay, I'm off!

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:00.690
Dorothy!

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:01.660
Wait up!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:02.690
Cya later!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.780
That girl... I guess there's no other choice.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:10.860
Let's carry on and combine our intellects tomorrow!

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:11.600
Okay.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.130
All goes well-nekon.

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:19.330
It seems they haven't yet made a new making drama for tomorrow-nekon.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:22.350
I can't think of anything-nano...

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:26.110
But the words "give up" don't exist in the Devil language.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.290
Garu...

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:30.510
Garu! It's so hard!

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.000
It...

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.350
It looks like a horn-nano!

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:37.710
Gajira looks strong!

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:39.730
A new Gajira making drama!

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:40.820
This is it!

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:46.340
To the PriPara fans around the world!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.080
Thanks for waiting!

00:08:56.850 --> 00:09:02.700
The Divine Idol Gran Prix Final Tournament is underway!

00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:08.720
Everyone! I want to see lots of effort and creativity!

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:12.240
I'm supporting you all!

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:14.490
Jewlie!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.250
It's a lie that you'll disappear right!?

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:17.700
You seem so happy!

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:19.170
I'm supporting you!

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:20.440
Goddesses!

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:24.580
Just wait, Jewlie. I'll save you all!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:35.480
I've gotta go-usa...

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:43.290
Garumageddon have drawn first!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:47.430
There's a bit of pressure in going first...

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.580
It doesn't matter-nekon.

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:53.440
Turn the tide by giving it your all and intimidating your opponent-nekon.

00:09:55.230 --> 00:10:02.740
By the way, in this tournament the managers will be introducing their idols!

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.940
Usagi-san isn't here!

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:06.850
You're right!

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:09.060
Where is he!?

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:10.460
What a coincidence-nekon...

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:16.420
I've gotta hurry-usa...

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.980
With that said, let's get going!

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:26.190
Garumageddon, do your best!

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.530
Scan the MyTickets required for your coord.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:46.910
You can scan your Friend Tickets too.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.510
Coord change start!

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:57.390
Garumageddon will duel in a new coord LoveDevi coord designed by Aroma-san!

00:10:57.390 --> 00:11:00.140
Classical Mode Gerbera Coord!

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:01.640
Devi!

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:06.550
Making a skirt out of stained glass?

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:08.140
I could've never imagined it...

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:11.150
Classical Mode Margaret coord!

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:12.550
Geru!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:17.680
Embroided entirely with rose-patterned lace

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:19.210
this coord appeals with it's elegance!

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:22.030
Classical Mode Blue Rose coord!

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.530
Garu!

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:31.080
Blessed by angels, devils and monsters, the invincible idols, Garumageddon!

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:35.670
They'll begin climbing the steps to Divine Idol right now-nekon!

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:40.260
Darkness! Aroma, the demon born from the darkness!

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:45.910
Shining! The angel born from the light, Mikan!

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:47.560
Garu!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:50.750
The monster born in PriPara-garu! Garuru!

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:55.440
Our powers combined will grant us victory!

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:58.970
Garumageddon!

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:02.180
I want to lick Garumageddon!

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.850
Making Drama, switch on!

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:21.990
Geru!
Garu!

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:25.360
Gajira.

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:46.000
Super Cyalume Change!

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:52.130
Devi!

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:52.760
Geru!

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:53.770
Garu!

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:29.010
We did it, the devil and angel landed on earth!

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:32.600
You did so well-nekon!

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:37.690
I've gotta hurry-usa...

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:42.350
Huh-usa?

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.190
Hey, panda!

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:46.280
What's up?

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:50.170
Put some of that in here please.

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:51.970
Gotcha.

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:56.840
I'm back-usa!

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:59.580
Thanks-usa!

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:02.650
What was up with that Making Drama?

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.020
It was really rock!

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.690
It was strong, but also cute...

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:13.120
Steady Progress.
The shine of something that keeps evolving...

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.640
If you're looking for rock, you've found it-usa!

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.600
Sorry to keep you waiting-usa!

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:20.130
Usagi-san, we were worried!

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:27.040
Yeah, but we still don't have a better making drama, we're gonna lose!

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:29.170
Don't give up-usa!

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:32.620
I can say this, having experienced the rock lifestyle,

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:36.470
you can achieve it with the spirit of rock-usa!

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:39.830
I see, we've gotta be more passionate!

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.990
All we thought about was our making drama,

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:46.900
and we became foolish...

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:51.120
all the while Garumageddon became quite the foes...

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.700
But, as long as we sing with passion...

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.790
We have rock!

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:59.820
Let's go with that in our performance!

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:12.790
Scan the MyTickets required for your coord.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.610
You can scan your Friend Tickets too.

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:17.660
Coord change start.

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:24.520
A hardcore, uniform-like coord fits Dressing Pafe perfectly!

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:26.630
Crosswalk Violet coord!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.140
Stripes alone are boring!

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:34.790
Add in some rock zig zag borders!

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:37.230
Crosswalk sky blue coord!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:45.250
With each member having their favorite color, everyone's happy!

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:47.750
Crosswalk scarlet coord!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.240
Thanks for waiting-usa!

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:55.870
We're gonna rock your socks off-usa!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.340
Rock Storm! Vivid Impression!

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:02.720
Here's Dressing Pafe-usa!

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:05.450
Return to Roots! Three people, one body!

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:07.940
The battling princesses!

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:10.000
And the powerful performance!

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:13.430
All come together, enjoy it!

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:27.270
Making Drama, switch on!

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:56.740
Super Cyalume Change!

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:02.240
<i>Go!</i>

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:02.920
Max!

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:03.720
Yay!

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:33.600
Dressing Pafe Jump!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.470
Amazing-garu!

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:39.410
Amazing teamwork-nekon...

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:42.360
I expected nothing less from the super idols

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:46.320
who stand shoulder to shoulder with Solami Smile in making Parajuku's Pripara what it is today-nekon.

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:49.760
A good duel with the devil-dearu!

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:54.710
Here are the results.

00:19:55.300 --> 00:20:00.810
Please "like" the team you thought was best in the first round!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.070
And the first round winners are...

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.470
Dressing Pafe!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.170
Yeah-usa!

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:37.990
I knew we were gonna win!

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:40.980
Allow me to thank,

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:48.450
Garumageddon for showing me how to truly appreciate performances.

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:49.680
I guess.

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:51.120
Thanks!

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:55.360
Amazing, they were both so good!

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:03.830
Let's take a look at the Diamond Statue!

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:06.240
Will the shining from the winners

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:09.120
unlock the Divine dress and Divine Heels?

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:18.530
Only a little chip, but

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:20.690
it's not released at all!

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:21.800
Eh!?

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:25.210
Why?

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:27.520
Sorry to say, but it looks

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:30.190
like the Divine Dress and Divine heels

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:32.520
won't be released any time soon.

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.000
No way!

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:38.460
So that means our power is lacking too much to release them!?

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:39.710
Seriously?

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:44.320
With that said, look forward to next time.

00:21:50.630 --> 00:21:52.850
Hell's cauldron has been sealed...

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.510
Aroma...

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.980
It hurts Garuru.

00:21:57.430 --> 00:21:59.880
But it's not over yet!

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:02.840
It's exactly as Garuru says-nekon.

00:22:03.030 --> 00:22:03.790
Devi.

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:06.420
The Devil is eternal!

00:22:06.980 --> 00:22:09.280
As long as we believe in resurrection, we can go on!

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:10.960
Angels believe in it!

00:22:10.960 --> 00:22:11.880
So does Garuru!

00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:12.920
Nekon!

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.700
The road for Garumageddon...

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:17.330
Is only just beginning!

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:18.700
Garu!
